        {
          "text": "Ndigacooka kũmahitha ũthiũ wakwa, nĩgũkorwo nĩngaitĩrĩria andũ a nyũmba ya Isiraeli Roho wakwa, ũguo nĩguo Mwathani Jehova ekuuga.”",
